## 📁 PROJECT STRUCTURE

```
Manufacturing-usecase/
│
├── 📦 integration_package/        ← DEPLOYMENT (copy this!)
│   ├── inspection_api.py          (REST API)
│   ├── best_damage_model.pt       (Model)
│   ├── requirements.txt           (Dependencies)
│   └── README.md                  (Setup)
│
├── 🔄 training/                   ← MODEL TRAINING
│   └── train_damage_detection_v1.py
│
├── 📊 evaluation/                 ← MODEL TESTING
│   └── evaluate_model.py
│
├── 🔧 preprocessing/              ← DATA PREP
│   └── dataset_cleaner.py
│
├── 📁 datasets/                   ← TRAINING DATA
│   └── dataset_cleaned/ (45 images)
│
├── 🤖 models/                     ← MODEL WEIGHTS
│   └── best_damage_model.pt
│
├── 📚 docs/                       ← GUIDES
│   ├── START_HERE.md
│   └── QUICK_START_INTEGRATION.md
│
├── 📊 reports/                    ← ANALYSIS
│   ├── EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY.txt
│   └── COMPREHENSIVE_EVALUATION_REPORT.txt
│
├── 📤 outputs/                    ← TRAINING ARTIFACTS
├── 🗑️ archive/                    ← OLD CODE
└── .git/                          ← VERSION CONTROL
```

