## 📋 PROJECT DETAILS

**Project Name:** Vehicle Damage Detection  
**Model:** YOLOv8 Nano (3.01M parameters)  
**Framework:** PyTorch + Ultralytics  
**API:** FastAPI (REST)  
**UI:** Optional Streamlit dashboard  
**Data Format:** YOLO normalized labels  
**Classes:** 5 damage types (dent, scratch, crack, broken_part, paint_damage)  

